      "text": "File Metadata\n- fileId\n- Name\n- Memtype\n- Size\n- CompressionAlgo\n- OwnerId\n- S3Link\n- Status: 'Started'\n- Chunks: [{\n        id as fingerprint,\n        status,\n        S3Link,\n        UpdatedTime\n    }]\n- CreateTime\n- UpdateTime\n- ...metadata",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
